                        notBefore="1946-08-20T00:00:00+01:00">undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 11</p>
                <p>The text of Article 11 of the Draft Peace Treaty with Italy should be considered
